// The walk on stars' matching schedule, the points over the threads: WoSX's
// WalkOnStars under its tbb::parallel_for over the sample points against
// the program's parfor over the points bound to the same pinned threads,
// as fcpwb-threads.bonsai is for the walk on spheres. The traversals are
// cpu/wost_fcpwb.bonsai's, FCPW's CPU order, the one-thread schedule's.
import apps/wosx/schedules/cpu/wost_fcpwb;

schedule {
    solve_stars.bind(i, CPUThread);
}
